{"sections":[{"slug":"赋值判别法","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"赋值判别法"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">赋值判别法</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"赋值判别法"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">映射</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">对所有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/赋值环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">赋值环</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">及其分式域</span> $K$, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑提升问题</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    \\operatorname{Spec}K &amp; \\to &amp; X\\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    \\operatorname{Spec}A &amp; \\to &amp; Y,\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">则</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$f$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/泛闭映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">泛闭映射</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">当且仅当该提升问题总有解</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">拟分离的假设下</span>, $f$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/分离态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分离</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">当且仅当该提升问题至多有一个解</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}